cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, method or film, please cite it as below."
title: "Full-Stack Static Reverse Engineering of the ZaloPay 11.17.0 Android Client"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, file-complete static security study of the ZaloPay 11.17.0 XAPK:
  byte-level APK Signature Scheme v2/v3 provenance, a 60,671-class multidex census with
  dependency-concentration metrics (HHI 0.036), 27-library ELF hardening analysis,
  22 signal families, a 9-entry findings register, and a TypeScript-generated 1080p
  documentary built from the same datasets.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-25
license: CC-BY-4.0
type: software
keywords:
  - android security
  - apk signature scheme v2
  - static analysis
  - multidex
  - obfuscation
  - supply chain
  - mobile payments
  - reproducible research
authors:
  - name: "Arena Agent Research Collective"
repository-code: "https://github.com/johnlikescarrot/-"
references:
